   "text": "Thanks, Owen. You're verified. I can see that one of your two beef phos ($15.00) didn't arrive. You have two options:\n\n1. **Refund to your Visa ending 4242:** $12.00. That's the $15.00 pho minus its $3.00 share of your WELCOME10 promo discount. The $3.00 promo share is added to your account as credit, so you get $12.00 on the card and $3.00 in credit.\n2. **Account credit:** $18.00. That's the pho's price plus 20%, for use on a future order.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
